WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:02,500
if we don't keep it

2
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:05,100
The next generation will definitely be able to take back Longmu City.

3
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,940
I have been a soldier for thirty years

4
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:10,620
I have fought big and small battles today.

5
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:13,500
But you have to watch them leave their hometown

6
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,860
I didn't defend this city well.

7
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:16,900
they withdraw

8
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:19,020
It's to free up our hands and feet

9
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:22,540
The place where the war is fought is at the root of the city

10
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:25,540
Even if we all die in battle

11
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:26,980
our descendants

12
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:28,180
our compatriots

13
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:31,060
Longmucheng will also be

14
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:32,620
take it back

15
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:35,640
I'm useless

16
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:38,540
Can't make up for Longmucheng

17
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:42,930
as chief general

18
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:47,760
But I want them to be homeless
